OL,3,GNEWSATaxi driver who refused assistance
OL,4,Adog loses licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA taxi driver has been stripped of his
OL,7,Flicence after refusing to carry a
OL,8,Fdisabled customer with an assistance
OL,9,Fdog.
OL,11,FRobert New, from Wirral, was also
OL,12,Fordered to pay costs totalling #1,120,
OL,13,Ftogether with a victim surcharge of
OL,14,F#48.
OL,16,FIt is unlawful for a private hire
OL,17,Fdriver to refuse a fare because a
OL,18,Fdisabled passenger is joined by an
OL,19,Fassistance dog under the Equality Act
OL,20,F2010.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
